-- ==================================================================
-- COCOON v3.7 — Continuous concurrent Hold/Place/Eject
-- - NON-STOP passes until button OFF
-- - Works for BABIES and PETS: records the subject's spot after
--   placement, then position-verified pickup after the dwell
-- - Teleports next to subject before every HoldBaby (distance check)
-- - Guaranteed eject on stop/error
-- ==================================================================
